// SYNTAX TEST "source.pibbles" "comments, notes, headers, text lines and tags"

// A comment line.
// <-- comment.line.double-slash.pibbles punctuation.definition.comment.pibbles
//   ^^^^^^^ comment.line.double-slash.pibbles

/// A note, reserved for localization.
// <------ comment.line.note.pibbles

//// A banner is a comment.
// <---- comment.line.double-slash.pibbles - comment.line.note.pibbles

== kitchen.fridge #was:kitchen.icebox // The old name still works.
// <-- meta.header.pibbles keyword.control.header.pibbles
// ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ entity.name.section.node.pibbles
//                ^^^^ meta.tag.pibbles entity.name.tag.pibbles
//                    ^ punctuation.separator.key-value.pibbles
//                     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ entity.name.section.node.pibbles
//                                    ^^ comment.line.double-slash.pibbles punctuation.definition.comment.pibbles

== .door
// ^^^^^ entity.name.section.node.pibbles

The kitchen smells of old coffee. #thought
// <---------------------------------- - entity.name.type.speaker.pibbles
//                                ^^^^^^^^ meta.tag.pibbles entity.name.tag.pibbles

mira: Hello there. #box:phone #id:k7qp2x
// <---- entity.name.type.speaker.pibbles
//  ^ punctuation.separator.speaker.pibbles
//                 ^^^^ meta.tag.pibbles entity.name.tag.pibbles
//                     ^ punctuation.separator.key-value.pibbles
//                      ^^^^^ string.unquoted.tag-value.pibbles
//                            ^^^^^^^^^^ comment.other.line-id.pibbles

mira (smug): I knew you'd come.
// <---- entity.name.type.speaker.pibbles
//   ^ punctuation.definition.pose.pibbles
//    ^^^^ variable.parameter.pose.pibbles
//        ^ punctuation.definition.pose.pibbles
//         ^ punctuation.separator.speaker.pibbles

mira (sad):
//    ^^^ variable.parameter.pose.pibbles

Note\: the door is locked. Not \#winning, but my #1 fan.
// <---- - entity.name.type.speaker.pibbles
//  ^^ constant.character.escape.pibbles
//                             ^^ constant.character.escape.pibbles
//                                               ^^ - meta.tag.pibbles

If you say so.
// <-- - keyword.control.pibbles

#idea is a tag, but #identity isn't an ID.
// <----- meta.tag.pibbles - comment.other.line-id.pibbles
//                  ^^^^^^^^^ meta.tag.pibbles - comment.other.line-id.pibbles
